repository-code: "https://github.com/tang-sir38/depthcheck"
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - Fano factor
  - library size
  - dispersion
  - normalization
abstract: >-
  Decomposes the Fano factor of normalized UMI counts into a term that depends
  only on per-cell library sizes and a gene-specific residual, and returns a
  pre-registered PASS/FAIL/AMBIGUOUS verdict on whether a between-group
  contrast is identifiable as a difference in transcriptional noise.
